{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：S01、S05这类短停留段，Y未标“到时出现”的感受词仍然过密；另外S13没有像X那样充分交代他想把喜欢藏回去、以减少未来受伤的自我保护动机。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的话语重点有明显的视觉锚点，普通观众更容易一眼抓住每段发生了什么；感受部分也不只是泛泛描述情绪，而是结合声部、力度、呼吸、身体感受和水波意象，细腻地呈现情绪变化。从开头的小船、水波，到中间的摇荡、暗流，再到结尾的定锚和音乐回应开头，Y的整体意象与音乐结构结合得更完整。X则胜在叙事因果交代得更充分，尤其人物为什么害怕、为什么反复收住喜欢、为什么最后不再隐藏，解释得更直接；但综合听觉体验、情绪细节和音乐画面感，我会选Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c61af551-3efe-4b5a-a692-b7cea96bdf7d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T123745629805Z", "elapsed_seconds": 157.735, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T12:40:23.379996+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5f56db2b029c3521d7f5a86518afee32d6186df390fad612f0bdae36d0f402ff", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f99